  "id": "reentrancy/routed-calls-from-a-room-s-deliveries-draw-on-its-cascade-s-budget",
  "title": "Messages a room's delivery sends that the router routes back into that room each draw one pass on the delivering cascade's budget; past it, one is refused after step 2, nothing of it stored, the attach or the sender's record kept",
  "rules": [
    "§8.3",
